WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Swimilana ni swiharhi swi cinca hi magoza loko misava yi kavanyisiwile.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Swimilana swo rhanga swi hatlisa ku mila swi funengeta misava ya hava.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Loko swi fa, matluka na mahlanga ya swona ma fepa misava.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Byanyi, mirhi yo nun'hwela na swihlahla leswi hanyaka nkarhi wo leha swa landzela swi sirhelela swilo leswi hanyaka.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:38.000
Laha eHighveld, ndhawu ya byanyi leyi hanyeke kahle yi nga hanya nkarhi wo leha.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:46.000
Tshika nhova ya purasi ra wena yi kula yi va vutshamo bya ntumbuluko bya ndhawu yoleyo.
